# Netlify redirects for vurell.com (rewritten 2026-10-16 with the SEO pass).
# The apex https://vurell.com/ is the primary domain. The old rule sent the apex to www, and www has
# no DNS record (#26), so it must never come back. Once the www CNAME exists, Netlify itself sends
# www to the primary domain.
#
# The pages of the earlier offer (the count, the message check, the reads, the illustrative
# engagement, the one-pager) were retired on 2026-10-16; old links from posts and DMs land on the
# home page. "!" forces the rule even if an old file is still in the publish folder.
/count     /  301!
/count/*   /  301!
/message   /  301!
/message/* /  301!
/reads     /  301!
/reads/*   /  301!
/engagement   /  301!
/engagement/* /  301!
/one-pager    /  301!
/one-pager/*  /  301!

# The domain's previous owner ran a watch shop on it, and Bing still lists its URLs (audit of
# 2026-10-17). 410 Gone tells crawlers they will not come back; the body is our 404 page.
/products      /404.html  410
/products/*    /404.html  410
/collections   /404.html  410
/collections/* /404.html  410
